{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873690/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1754392015\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873690/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1754392015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873690/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.mp4?t=1754392015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET SUMMER INGRID!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Less clothing, better tan! That's the motto of gorgeous Ingrid, who's set aside her Helian pride for a well-deserved summer break. Leave morality to the saints, Ingrid's planning to become the star of the nude beach!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't be fooled by her stern gaze\u2014rub some sunscreen on her back and she'll melt into a soft, radiant smile and wrap you in warmth and affection. Play beach volleyball together, race to the buoy, and then lie back on the soft white sand, stargazing as Ingrid's kisses burn hot against your skin...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873690/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.avif?t=1754392015\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Summer Ingrid as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll also receive 10,000 Gold, 100 Rubies and 10 Common Mystic Tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragra